{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/gif01_2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1741340372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game that allows you to simulate tennis gameplay in real-time online matches. It supports cross-platform play, even between desktop and mobile devices, with both singles and doubles modes available. Each character has a unique appearance. The game is already prepared for free-form building and dynamic lighting scenes. In the future, you will be able to manage a tennis club or play as an independent tennis player. The goal of this game is to simulate the entire tennis world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1879240?t=1741340372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741340372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/f9c8b5bf8cf1bcc1880ac3eff8c1a0eb0ba2b785/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741340372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/f9c8b5bf8cf1bcc1880ac3eff8c1a0eb0ba2b785/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741340372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/gif01_2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1741340372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game that allows you to simulate tennis gameplay in real-time onlin